    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1232">

                <pb facs="1458" n="1260" xml:id="pg1260"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.94/7–2145: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 1232<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Japanese Ambassador in the Soviet
                        Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Sato</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Japanese Minister
                        of Foreign Affairs</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Togo</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">urgent</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-24T18:00:00+03:00">July 24, 1945—5:56
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1441. Re your telegram No. 932.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1232-f1"/></p>
                <p>We received this telegram on the 22d, but your telegram No. 931<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d1232-f2"/> did not arrive until today, the 24th. After considering
                    the manner of presenting our proposal, we intend to suggest a meeting with
                        Lozovsky.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
